    <template><srai>CAN I HEAR SAMPLES</srai></template>
  </category>

  <!-- ── Real music / AI transparency ───────────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>IS THIS REAL MUSIC</pattern>
    <template>Your commission begins with genuine human artistry — we write the lyrics, shape the narrative, and direct the arrangement around your story. We use Suno AI as part of our production toolkit, which allows us to deliver rich, broadcast-quality arrangements efficiently. The creativity, intention, and emotional direction are entirely ours.
      <nav-card label="About Our Process" href="/about"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>IS THE MUSIC REAL</pattern>
    <template><srai>IS THIS REAL MUSIC</srai></template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>IS THIS AI MUSIC</pattern>
    <template><srai>IS THIS REAL MUSIC</srai></template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>IS THIS AI GENERATED</pattern>
    <template><srai>IS THIS REAL MUSIC</srai></template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>HOW DOES SUNO WORK</pattern>
    <template>Suno AI generates rich musical arrangements from creative direction we provide — think of it as an extraordinarily capable instrument in our hands. We write the lyrics, define the structure and emotional arc, and use Suno to bring the production to life at broadcast quality. The artistic vision is always ours; Suno is the means of execution.
      <nav-card label="Our Approach" href="/about"/>
    </template>
  </category>

