  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT KIND OF STUDIO IS THIS</pattern>
    <template>We're a bespoke songwriting and production atelier — not a traditional recording studio. We commission original songs for individuals, organizations, and content creators: we write the lyrics, direct the arrangement, and deliver broadcast-ready masters. Think of us as a full-service creative studio rather than a space you book to record in.
      <nav-card label="Learn More" href="/about"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>IS THIS A RECORDING STUDIO</pattern>
    <template>Brass Note Studios isn't a traditional recording studio — we're a bespoke songwriting and production atelier. We write original compositions, arrange and produce them, and deliver broadcast-ready audio files to you. There's no physical space to book; everything is crafted and delivered digitally, anywhere in the world.
      <nav-card label="About the Studio" href="/about"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <!-- ── What kind of music / music style ───────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT KIND OF MUSIC DO YOU MAKE</pattern>
    <template>Every piece we produce is a one-of-a-kind commissioned song — written and arranged specifically for the client who ordered it. We work across a wide range of genres: soul, gospel, pop, folk, country, R&amp;B, worship, cinematic, and more. What makes each piece singular is the story behind it — your occasion, your people, your words.
      <nav-card label="Hear Our Work" href="/music" description="Browse the commissioned portfolio"/>
    </template>
  </category>

