  <category>
    <pattern>DO YOU HAVE MUSIC ON SPOTIFY</pattern>
    <template>We do — several studio-quality albums produced using Suno AI are available on Spotify. They're a testament to what's possible when real musical knowledge guides the production process. You can also listen to commissioned work right here on our Music page.
      <nav-card label="Music Portfolio" href="/music" description="Listen to our work"/>
    </template>
