  <category>
    <pattern>WHO IS DEJANAE WEICKUM</pattern>
    <template>DeJanae Weickum co-founded Brass Note Studios alongside Shane. She's a musician and songwriter whose artistry and perspective shape the studio's creative voice. Together they bring 30+ years of combined experience in music and performance.
      <nav-card label="About the Studio" href="/about"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
