    <template>Brass Note Studios was co-founded by Shane and DeJanae Weickum, so every commission benefits from two experienced musicians and songwriters. We're a small, dedicated studio — which means your project gets genuine personal attention, not a production line.
      <nav-card label="Meet the Founders" href="/about"/>
    </template>
